    title: "Spanning Tree Protocol (STP)",
    bodyHtml: `<h3 class="holo-text" style="margin-bottom:12px">STP — Preventing Network Loops</h3>
<p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:16px">STP prevents broadcast storms caused by Layer 2 loops in redundant switch topologies. It blocks redundant paths while keeping them available for failover.</p>

<h4 style="margin:12px 0 8px;">Why Loops Are Dangerous</h4>
<div class="neu-inset" style="padding:14px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;">
Without STP, a broadcast frame would loop infinitely between switches:<br>
• Frames multiply exponentially (broadcast storm)<br>
• MAC address table becomes unstable (flapping)<br>
• Network grinds to a halt within seconds<br>
• CPU on switches spikes to 100%
</div>

<h4 style="margin:16px 0 8px;">STP Port States</h4>
<table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;">
<tbody><tr style="background:rgba(99,102,241,0.1);"><th style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">State</th><th style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Forwards Data?</th><th style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Learns MACs?</th><th style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Duration</th></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);color:#ef4444;font-weight:600;">Blocking</td><td style="padding:6px;">No</td><td style="padding:6px;">No</td><td style="padding:6px;">20 sec (max age)</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);color:#f59e0b;font-weight:600;">Listening</td><td style="padding:6px;">No</td><td style="padding:6px;">No</td><td style="padding:6px;">15 sec (forward delay)</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);color:#3b82f6;font-weight:600;">Learning</td><td style="padding:6px;">No</td><td style="padding:6px;">Yes</td><td style="padding:6px;">15 sec (forward delay)</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);color:#10b981;font-weight:600;">Forwarding</td><td style="padding:6px;">Yes</td><td style="padding:6px;">Yes</td><td style="padding:6px;">—</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);color:#6b7280;font-weight:600;">Disabled</td><td style="padding:6px;">No</td><td style="padding:6px;">No</td><td style="padding:6px;">Admin shutdown</td></tr>
</tbody></table>

<h4 style="margin:16px 0 8px;">STP Versions</h4>
<table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;">
<tbody><tr style="background:rgba(99,102,241,0.1);"><th style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Version</th><th style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Standard</th><th style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Convergence</th><th style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Notes</th></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">STP</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">802.1D</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">30-50 sec</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Original, slow</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">RSTP</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">802.1w</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">1-2 sec</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Rapid, preferred</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">MSTP</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">802.1s</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">1-2 sec</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Multiple instances</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">PVST+</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Cisco</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">30-50 sec</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Per-VLAN STP</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Rapid PVST+</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Cisco</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">1-2 sec</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Per-VLAN Rapid STP ✅</td></tr>
</tbody></table>`,
