    title: "Inter-VLAN Routing",
    bodyHtml: `<h3 class="holo-text" style="margin-bottom:12px">Inter-VLAN Routing Methods</h3>
<p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:16px">Devices in different VLANs need a Layer 3 device (router or L3 switch) to communicate.</p>

<h4 style="margin:12px 0 8px;">Three Methods</h4>
<table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;">
<tbody><tr style="background:rgba(99,102,241,0.1);"><th style="padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Method</th><th style="padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">How</th><th style="padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Pros</th><th style="padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Cons</th></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);font-weight:600;">Legacy (Separate interfaces)</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">One router port per VLAN</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Simple</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Wastes router ports</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);font-weight:600;">Router-on-a-Stick</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Sub-interfaces on one trunk link</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Uses 1 port</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Bandwidth bottleneck</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);font-weight:600;">L3 Switch (SVI)</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Switch Virtual Interfaces</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Fastest, scalable</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Requires L3 switch</td></tr>
</tbody></table>

<h4 style="margin:16px 0 8px;">Router-on-a-Stick Config</h4>
<div class="neu-inset" style="padding:12px;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;">
Router(config)# <span style="color:#10b981;">interface gi0/0.10</span><br>
Router(config-subif)# <span style="color:#10b981;">encapsulation dot1Q 10</span><br>
Router(config-subif)# <span style="color:#10b981;">ip address 192.168.10.1 255.255.255.0</span><br><br>
Router(config)# <span style="color:#3b82f6;">interface gi0/0.20</span><br>
Router(config-subif)# <span style="color:#3b82f6;">encapsulation dot1Q 20</span><br>
Router(config-subif)# <span style="color:#3b82f6;">ip address 192.168.20.1 255.255.255.0</span>
</div>`,
