    icon: "🔐",
    title: "Port Security & DHCP Snooping",
    bodyHtml: `<h3 class="holo-text" style="margin-bottom:12px">Layer 2 Security — Port Security, DHCP Snooping, DAI</h3>

<h4 style="margin:12px 0 8px;">Port Security</h4>
<div class="neu-inset" style="padding:14px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;">
Limits the number of MAC addresses allowed on a switch port. Prevents:<br>
• MAC flooding attacks<br>
• Unauthorized device connections<br><br>
<strong>Violation Modes:</strong><br>
<strong style="color:#ef4444;">Shutdown</strong> — Err-disables the port (default, most secure)<br>
<strong style="color:#f59e0b;">Restrict</strong> — Drops violating traffic, logs event, port stays up<br>
<strong style="color:#3b82f6;">Protect</strong> — Drops violating traffic silently, no log
</div>

<h4 style="margin:16px 0 8px;">DHCP Snooping</h4>
<div class="neu-inset" style="padding:14px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;">
Prevents rogue DHCP servers from assigning IPs to clients.<br><br>
<strong>Trusted Ports:</strong> Uplinks to DHCP server (allow DHCP offers)<br>
<strong>Untrusted Ports:</strong> Access ports (block DHCP offers from here)<br><br>
Builds a <strong>DHCP binding table</strong> (IP → MAC → Port → VLAN) used by DAI and IP Source Guard.
</div>

<h4 style="margin:16px 0 8px;">Dynamic ARP Inspection (DAI)</h4>
<div class="neu-inset" style="padding:14px;font-size:13px;">
Validates ARP packets against the DHCP snooping binding table.<br>
Prevents ARP spoofing/poisoning attacks.<br>
<strong>Requires DHCP snooping as a prerequisite!</strong>
</div>

<h4 style="margin:16px 0 8px;">Configuration</h4>
<div class="neu-inset" style="padding:12px;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;">
<span style="color:var(--text-muted);">! Port Security</span><br>
Switch(config-if)# <span style="color:#10b981;">switchport port-security</span><br>
Switch(config-if)# <span style="color:#10b981;">switchport port-security maximum 2</span><br>
Switch(config-if)# <span style="color:#10b981;">switchport port-security violation restrict</span><br>
Switch(config-if)# <span style="color:#10b981;">switchport port-security mac-address sticky</span><br><br>
<span style="color:var(--text-muted);">! DHCP Snooping</span><br>
Switch(config)# <span style="color:#3b82f6;">ip dhcp snooping</span><br>
Switch(config)# <span style="color:#3b82f6;">ip dhcp snooping vlan 10,20</span><br>
Switch(config-if)# <span style="color:#3b82f6;">ip dhcp snooping trust</span> <span style="color:var(--text-muted);">(on uplink to DHCP server)</span><br><br>
<span style="color:var(--text-muted);">! DAI</span><br>
Switch(config)# <span style="color:#f59e0b;">ip arp inspection vlan 10,20</span><br>
Switch(config-if)# <span style="color:#f59e0b;">ip arp inspection trust</span> <span style="color:var(--text-muted);">(on uplink)</span>
</div>`,
