    bodyHtml: `<h3 class="holo-text" style="margin-bottom:12px">MPLS — Multi-Protocol Label Switching</h3>
<p style="color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:16px">MPLS forwards packets based on labels instead of IP addresses, enabling faster switching and advanced VPN services (L2VPN, L3VPN).</p>

<h4 style="margin:12px 0 8px;">MPLS Components</h4>
<table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;">
<tbody><tr style="background:rgba(99,102,241,0.1);"><th style="padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Component</th><th style="padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Role</th></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);font-weight:600;">LER (Label Edge Router)</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Pushes/pops labels at MPLS domain edge (PE router)</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);font-weight:600;">LSR (Label Switch Router)</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Swaps labels in the core (P router)</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);font-weight:600;">LSP (Label Switched Path)</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">The path a labeled packet takes through the network</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);font-weight:600;">FEC (Forwarding Equivalence Class)</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Group of packets treated the same way</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);font-weight:600;">LDP (Label Distribution Protocol)</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border);">Distributes labels between routers</td></tr>
</tbody></table>

<div class="neu-inset" style="margin-top:16px;padding:14px;font-size:13px;">
<strong>MPLS Label Operations:</strong><br>
<strong>Push</strong> — Add label (ingress LER)<br>
<strong>Swap</strong> — Change label (core LSR)<br>
<strong>Pop</strong> — Remove label (egress LER, or PHP — penultimate hop popping)
</div>`,
